    affiliation: "Department of Mathematics and Statistics, University of Helsinki"
  - family-names: Loher
    given-names: Amélie
    affiliation: "All Souls College, University of Oxford"
keywords:
  - Lean
  - mathlib
  - formal verification
  - stochastic homogenization
  - high contrast
  - coarse graining
  - partial differential equations
